# combat-spells: the parley-combat fight, but the party casts: Brother Sean blesses (C, End to the first spell, Enter), Rhiannon and Darkstar cast Sleep
# (C, ENTER, then T for the aim prompt's Target: the spell lands on whoever is in the cursor, a party member included), the others
# take quick turns (Q); then quick turns to the Continue Battle prompt. Covers the combat spell menus (ovl22 PickSpellFromMenu,
# CastBless, CastSleep, ApplySpellToTargets), the affects they apply (ovl12) and the aim prompt (ovl13/ovl24). Found by trying
# the party's spells turn by turn on the oracle. Waits give the combat animations time; shots follow a key at once.
