wait 60
press H                  # rest time: Hours
wait 20
press I                  # Inc, eight times
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press R                  # start resting; a monster appears
wait 900
shot encounter
